YOLO26 object detector (ncnn model artifacts)
---------------------------------------------
The object detection capacity of this service runs Ultralytics YOLO26 model
artifacts (`yolo26n.param` / `yolo26n.bin`, exported from `yolo26n.pt`).

Ultralytics YOLO26 is licensed under AGPL-3.0:
  Source:     https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
  Weights:    https://huggingface.co/Ultralytics/YOLO26
  License:    https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics/blob/main/LICENSE
              (GNU Affero General Public License v3.0)

This service does not distribute Ultralytics source code or weights; the
artifacts are downloaded and exported on the user's own installation by
`scripts/setup.sh camera`. For commercial (non-AGPL) distribution, replace
the model artifacts behind the `IObjectDetector` seam (for example RF-DETR
Nano) without touching the service code.

